WEBVTT

00:22:55.326 --> 00:23:02.326
and I just cannot tell you
how thrilled and privileged I am

00:23:02.350 --> 00:23:05.379
to have this opportunity
and to have this opportunity to share,

00:23:05.403 --> 00:23:06.861
and I want you to know

00:23:06.885 --> 00:23:08.247
I am going to keep fighting.

00:23:08.271 --> 00:23:10.185
A lot of us are going to keep fighting,

00:23:10.209 --> 00:23:15.439
and you have caused us to believe
that we cannot rest until justice comes.

00:23:15.463 --> 00:23:17.235
And I want you to thank you for that.

00:23:17.259 --> 00:23:18.450
JL: Wish you well.

00:23:18.474 --> 00:23:20.834
BS: Absolutely, my friend.
Absolutely. Bless you.

00:23:20.858 --> 00:23:22.800
JL: OK. Bless you, brother.

00:23:22.824 --> 00:23:24.714
BS: Thank you. Thank you.

00:23:25.819 --> 00:23:28.955
[Congressman John Lewis
February 21, 1940 - July 17, 2020]

00:23:28.979 --> 00:23:31.148
[Rest in Peace]